<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">自从对你道出「初次见面」的那天起</text><text for="L2">我就一直在翘首以盼</text><text for="L3">天天盼着这重逢的一天</text><text for="L4">看到你那闪闪发光的眼眸里</text><text for="L5">宿着耀眼的光芒</text><text for="L6">迈步踏上这片广袤的大地</text><text for="L7">一路邂逅未知的相遇 必定能够</text><text for="L8">寻获属于你自己的</text><text for="L9">那颗独一无二的太晶宝藏</text><text for="L10">把一路走来的冒险足迹全都存个档</text><text for="L11">统统存好毫无保留</text><text for="L12">快点跟上出发吧</text><text for="L13">红蓝翠绿 斑斓绚烂的五彩缤纷</text><text for="L14">去寻宝吧 偶尔绕绕远路也无妨</text><text for="L15">好想切磋过过招 那么就让我们一起倒数</text><text for="L16">3.2.1!</text><text for="L17">「就决定是你了」</text><text for="L18">新的一天帷幕就此拉开</text><text for="L19">来吧 让我尽情感受这份雀跃</text><text for="L20">胸口小鹿乱撞的心跳</text><text for="L21">根本停不下来 谁也按捺不住</text><text for="L22">千锤百炼不断打磨的</text><text for="L23">这一招带着电流噼里啪啦 呼啸炸裂</text><text for="L24">瞄准目标果断出手</text><text for="L25">保持手感 乘胜追击</text><text for="L26">来吧 做出你的选择</text><text for="L27">奔跑在这硕果累累的闪耀瞬间</text><text for="L28">冲吧 我们的热情没有极限</text><text for="L29">电流噼啪作响</text><text for="L30">此刻正与你并肩</text><text for="L31">战局灼热焦灼</text><text for="L32">再多来一点刺激吧</text><text for="L33">紧绷刺痛的快感</text><text for="L34">真切鲜活地活着</text><text for="L35">哪怕命悬一线的极限时刻</text><text for="L36">也要尽情去享受</text><text for="L37">金银水晶耀眼夺目</text><text for="L38">但我想要的才不是那些寻常东西</text><text for="L39">不管你是新手菜鸟 还是道馆馆主</text><text for="L40">不管是谁我都奉陪到底</text><text for="L41">在苍天之下 跨越翡翠色的大海</text><text for="L42">探寻那万绿从中一点红的耀眼身影</text><text for="L43">复杂棘手的难题先丢在一旁</text><text for="L44">直接奔向藏着无尽乐趣的城镇</text><text for="L45">黑白分明决出胜负</text><text for="L46">要是说起宝可梦对战的秘诀</text><text for="L47">从头到尾我都了然于胸</text><text for="L48">终于遇见了你</text><text for="L49">兜兜转转终于等到了这场相遇</text><text for="L50">让我用心感受这份狂热</text><text for="L51">这扑通扑通的心跳</text><text for="L52">你是不是也和我一样呢</text><text for="L53">阳光遍洒的清晨</text><text for="L54">明月高悬的夜晚</text><text for="L55">一路累积至今的全部汗水</text><text for="L56">就让我们在此刻全力碰撞</text><text for="L57">堂堂正正一决高下</text><text for="L58">怎么可能还停得下来</text><text for="L59">梦寐以求的瞬间</text><text for="L60">就在这个华丽的对战擂台上</text><text for="L61">「就决定是你了」</text><text for="L62">苦苦等待的这一刻 终于到来</text><text for="L63">心口扑通扑通狂跳</text><text for="L64">顺着这澎湃的脉搏向前冲吧</text><text for="L65">千锤百炼打磨而成的</text><text for="L66">这一记大招噼啪带电 轰鸣爆发</text><text for="L67">稳稳锁定胜局</text><text for="L68">保持节奏 乘胜追击</text><text for="L69">来吧 亮出你的宝可梦</text><text for="L70">让我们写下最棒的丰收时刻</text><text for="L71">无论何时都冲破极限 永不设限</text><text for="L72">哪怕是一脸耍酷冷淡的你</text><text for="L73">哪怕是内向害羞不敢搭话的你</text><text for="L74">跟垂头丧气的昨天潇洒说拜拜</text><text for="L75">把灿烂的未来抓在手心</text><text for="L76">电流噼里啪啦</text><text for="L77">此刻与你并肩</text><text for="L78">战局灼热如火</text><text for="L79">渴望更多心跳加速</text><text for="L80">刺痛紧绷的狂热</text><text for="L81">尽情感受心跳吧</text><text for="L82">哪怕千钧一发的极限时刻</text><text for="L83">也要笑着玩到尽兴</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Biri-Biri"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOASOBI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Biri-Biri - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716254220"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPP302300628"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:12.363" end="0:44.907" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:12.363" end="0:14.280" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.363" end="0:13.452">「はじめまして」</span><span begin="0:13.452" end="0:13.693">した</span><span begin="0:13.693" end="0:14.280">日から</span></p><p begin="0:14.395" end="0:15.839" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.395" end="0:14.977">ずっと</span><span begin="0:14.977" end="0:15.470">待って</span><span begin="0:15.470" end="0:15.839">いた</span></p><p begin="0:16.730" end="0:18.715" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.730" end="0:17.107">この</span><span begin="0:17.270" end="0:17.554">日を</span><span begin="0:17.616" end="0:18.316">想って</span><span begin="0:18.316" end="0:18.715">いた</span></p><p begin="0:18.758" end="0:21.079" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.758" end="0:19.722">キラキラ</span><span begin="0:19.722" end="0:19.990">その</span><span begin="0:19.990" end="0:20.385">目に</span><span begin="0:20.385" end="0:21.079">宿った</span></p><p begin="0:21.128" end="0:23.064" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.128" end="0:21.944">光</span><span begin="0:21.944" end="0:22.291">を</span><span begin="0:22.291" end="0:23.064">見たんだ</span></p><p begin="0:23.178" end="0:25.865" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.178" end="0:23.903">広がる</span><span begin="0:23.903" end="0:24.359">この</span><span begin="0:24.359" end="0:25.116">大地を</span><span begin="0:25.116" end="0:25.865">歩いて</span></p><p begin="0:25.996" end="0:28.696" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.996" end="0:26.641">新たな</span><span begin="0:26.641" end="0:27.389">出会いに</span><span begin="0:27.389" end="0:27.968">触れて</span><span begin="0:27.968" end="0:28.696">きっと</span></p><p begin="0:28.796" end="0:29.981" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.796" end="0:29.242">見つけ</span><span begin="0:29.242" end="0:29.551">出</span><span begin="0:29.551" end="0:29.981">せる</span></p><p begin="0:30.094" end="0:31.415" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.094" end="0:30.362">きみ</span><span begin="0:30.362" end="0:30.863">だけの</span><span begin="0:30.863" end="0:31.415">ジュエル</span></p><p begin="0:31.546" end="0:32.775" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.546" end="0:31.694">その</span><span begin="0:31.694" end="0:32.299">軌跡を</span><span begin="0:32.299" end="0:32.775">セーブ</span></p><p begin="0:32.962" end="0:34.094" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.962" end="0:33.432">全部</span><span begin="0:33.432" end="0:34.094">全部</span></p><p begin="0:34.094" end="0:35.136" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.094" end="0:34.880">Hurry</span> <span begin="0:34.880" end="0:35.136">up!</span></p><p begin="0:35.179" end="0:37.878" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.179" end="0:35.905">赤青</span><span begin="0:35.905" end="0:36.417">緑</span><span begin="0:36.417" end="0:36.920">色</span><span begin="0:36.920" end="0:37.460">とり</span><span begin="0:37.460" end="0:37.878">どり</span></p><p begin="0:37.946" end="0:40.649" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.946" end="0:38.992">宝探し</span> <span begin="0:38.992" end="0:39.579">たまに</span><span begin="0:39.579" end="0:40.187">寄り</span><span begin="0:40.187" end="0:40.649">道</span></p><p begin="0:40.730" end="0:43.430" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.730" end="0:41.491">手合わせ</span><span begin="0:41.491" end="0:42.017">願う</span> <span begin="0:42.017" end="0:42.669">それじゃ</span><span begin="0:42.669" end="0:43.430">一緒に</span></p><p begin="0:43.430" end="0:44.907" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.430" end="0:43.875">3.</span><span begin="0:43.991" end="0:44.466">2.</span><span begin="0:44.517" end="0:44.907">1!</span></p></div><div begin="0:45.628" end="1:08.990" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:45.628" end="0:46.894" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.628" end="0:46.158">「キミに</span><span begin="0:46.158" end="0:46.894">きめた！」</span></p><p begin="0:47.885" end="0:49.714" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.885" end="0:48.497">今日も</span><span begin="0:48.497" end="0:49.003">幕が</span><span begin="0:49.003" end="0:49.714">開けた</span></p><p begin="0:50.762" end="0:51.962" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.762" end="0:51.046">Let me</span><span begin="0:51.046" end="0:51.280">そう</span><span begin="0:51.280" end="0:51.568">Let me</span> <span begin="0:51.568" end="0:51.962">feel</span></p><p begin="0:53.459" end="0:54.677" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.459" end="0:54.346">ドキドキが</span><span begin="0:54.346" end="0:54.677">もう</span></p><p begin="0:54.777" end="0:56.544" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.777" end="0:55.542">止まらない</span><span begin="0:55.542" end="0:56.544">止められない</span></p><p begin="0:56.743" end="0:57.892" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.743" end="0:57.205">磨き</span><span begin="0:57.205" end="0:57.892">続けた</span></p><p begin="0:58.076" end="1:00.211" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.076" end="0:58.874">一撃を</span><span begin="0:58.874" end="0:59.881">ビリビリと</span><span begin="0:59.881" end="1:00.211">今</span></p><p begin="1:00.476" end="1:01.707" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.476" end="1:00.969">狙い</span><span begin="1:00.969" end="1:01.707">定めて</span></p><p begin="1:01.707" end="1:02.624" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.707" end="1:02.055">Keep it,</span> <span begin="1:02.055" end="1:02.369">keep it</span> <span begin="1:02.369" end="1:02.624">up!</span></p><p begin="1:02.749" end="1:04.598" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.749" end="1:03.123">さあ</span><span begin="1:03.123" end="1:03.576">Pick out</span><span begin="1:03.576" end="1:04.125">..</span><span begin="1:04.125" end="1:04.598">.</span></p><p begin="1:04.712" end="1:07.257" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.712" end="1:05.591">実りある</span><span begin="1:05.591" end="1:06.410">瞬間を</span><span begin="1:06.410" end="1:06.823">駆け</span><span begin="1:06.823" end="1:06.923">る</span><span begin="1:07.110" end="1:07.257">の</span></p><p begin="1:07.257" end="1:08.990" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.257" end="1:07.797">行こう</span><span begin="1:07.797" end="1:08.026">No</span> <span begin="1:08.026" end="1:08.360">limit,</span> <span begin="1:08.360" end="